{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/815039-about-fallout-4-and-demon-mild-spoilers-from-the-game","id":815039,"title":"About Fallout 4 and Demon (Mild spoilers from the game)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-23T14:36:51-08:00","id":815039,"title":"About Fallout 4 and Demon (Mild spoilers from the game)","content":"So I was playing Fallout 4, and got to thinking about the Railroad as an agency. You know, the whole, demons and humans helping demons/angels and humans/stigmatics escape the control of the God Machine. I've got some ideas, but I would like to hear what comes to mind when you consider this. <br /> Also, i love the creepy humanoid robot design that are the synths in Fallout 4. Also, the coursers are really nice examples of scary angels in human form, looking for escaped synths/demons. Bring back, rebuild/repurpose...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5260-themangynimrod","name":"TheMangyNimrod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-23T17:26:54-08:00","id":815127,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't care to see the Railroad copied too ham-handedly; however, I couldn't help but think about the group as I read the Demon corebook. I could see a group consisting of stigmatics form organically upon consciously triggering an Angel to fall. Perhaps this first demon serves as an ally of the group, fighting to claim his former allies from the God-machine's control? If it seems like an interesting way to go, then by all means...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0